    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Red Wizards, ability to use a Spellcasting Focus<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Recruit</p><p>Red Wizards defend their strongholds with Undead minions. The necropolis can house up to eight Bastion Defenders.</p><p><strong>Recruit: Undead Defenders.</strong> Each Recruit order creates up to four Undead Bastion Defenders, who shelter in its crypts and burial chambers. You can't issue this order if the necropolis is full. Track the Undead defenders you lose: each returns to the necropolis 14 days after being destroyed, unless the facility is shut down or full.</p><p><em>Source: Forgotten Realms: Heroes of Faerûn.</em></p>",
